    "Includes notes, original photos and audio, tasks, calendar, finance, settings and the encrypted vault. The vault still requires its own master password. API keys are excluded. Keep the recovery code separately from this file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Includes notes, original photos and audio, tasks, calendar, finance, settings and the encrypted vault. The vault still requires its own master password. API keys are excluded. Keep the recovery code separately from this file."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "包含便签、保存的照片和录音、任务、日程、收支、设置及加密密码库。密码库仍需原主密码；不包含 API 密钥。请将恢复码与备份文件分开保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
